@startuml
title Review readiness matrix flow

actor "Hero proposer" as hero
actor "Cobold reviewer" as cobold
participant "Angular UI" as ui
participant "NestJS BFF" as bff
participant "Spring Boot API" as api

hero -> ui: Enter change details\nselect surfaces and risks
ui -> bff: POST /api/cobold-vs-hero/briefing
bff -> api: POST /api/cobold-vs-hero/briefing
api -> api: derive required evidence\ncreate planned state
api --> bff: evidence items + NOT_READY gaps
bff -> bff: map backend contract to UI DTO
bff --> ui: UI readiness response
hero -> ui: attach evidence URL as developer
ui -> bff: POST attach
bff -> api: validate planned -> attached
cobold -> ui: approve or reject as assigned reviewer
ui -> bff: POST approve/reject
bff -> api: validate role + transition\nrecalculate readiness
api --> bff: updated evidence + readiness
bff --> ui: READY only when all required items are approved

@enduml
